		{"id":"9b92d064565343bd","type":"text","text":"Project task:\n* Use all 3 procedural modeling concepts learned during lectures (terrain modeling, hard surface modeling and flora modeling) + some new concepts for solving the task.\n* Idea with the project task is to show that concepts and methods learned in this lectures can be applied to a wide range of applications. \n","x":18180,"y":-505,"width":465,"height":262,"color":"3"},
