		{"id":"bc9265c303b73840","type":"text","text":"Houdini creates a directory where Houdini source file (.hip) will be stored as well as default directories for organizing work:\n* abc/\n* audio/\n* backup/\n* comp/\n* desk/\n* flip/\n* **geo/**\n* hda/\n* **render/**\n* scripts/\n* sim/\n* tex/\n* video/\n* HelloWorld.hip (this file is created later with Save as... option)","x":13905,"y":-1057,"width":400,"height":532},
		{"id":"b213757eaba7d7d9","type":"text","text":"File -> Save as...","x":13473,"y":-699,"width":250,"height":60},
