		{"id":"a9dc1d13bb0b47a2","type":"text","text":"Select `obj/` network to build 3D scene","x":13359,"y":798,"width":250,"height":94},
		{"id":"e4398d4d21a6d9df","type":"text","text":"Select \"Build\" Desktop\n\nDesktop presets. For starters:\n1. **Build** (modeling and animation)\n2. **Solaris** (staging and rendering)\n3. Output (rendering and exporting)\n4. Image (compositing)\n\nNB: Desktops can be customized by adding windows and changing view","x":13108,"y":-504,"width":430,"height":300},
