		{"id":"1a4ca98c663fb0a4","type":"text","text":"Core concept: **Learning by doing**\n\nGoals:\n- **Learning procedural concepts** by\n- **Practical project-based procedural modeling**","x":10260,"y":-2109,"width":815,"height":250},
