		{"id":"594ff54273224837","type":"text","text":"\n* Camera and light have to be added to `obj/` network\n* Materials have to be created in `obj/` network\n* Open `Output` Desktop preset\n* Select `out/` network\n* Create Mantra renderer\n* Configure Mantra renderer and render","x":13240,"y":3833,"width":395,"height":299},
		{"id":"9f209aef3937011c","type":"text","text":"* `obj/` network contains only geometry with colors\n* Open Solaris Desktop preset\n* Select `stage/` network and link geometry, create materials, add lights and cameras and Karma renderer","x":14208,"y":3842,"width":452,"height":251},
