		{"id":"1e15c9aeabee022b","type":"text","text":"In `Stage/` network add:\n1. `ImportSop` Node for adding geometry from obj/geo/ network.\n2. `MaterialLibrary` and `MaterialLinker` Node for creating and assigning material.\n3. `PhysicalSky` Node for physically-based lighting\n4. `Camera` Node. Make sure to adjust camera position and paramters (selecting camera, locking camera, transforming, unlocking)\n5. `KarmaRenderer` Node for rendering. Make sure to adjust properties as required.","x":14208,"y":4176,"width":452,"height":371},
		{"id":"4aca7bcf12496d3f","type":"text","text":"Procedural modeling: https://www.sustainabledesignacademy.com/courses/organic-and-procedural-modeling-with-maya3d","x":9202,"y":-2105,"width":250,"height":180,"color":"#808f56"},
