		{"id":"2271d559c0473285","type":"text","text":"Natural and abstract organic structures:\n* Growth and spread\n* Iterative phenomenological models\n* Morphogenesis","x":4707,"y":-332,"width":448,"height":177},
		{"id":"9c1b064a4330c31d","type":"text","text":"* Parametric surface and volume material\n* Material parameters: color, roughness, density, etc.\n* Texture and geometry of material","x":4707,"y":630,"width":448,"height":180},
		{"id":"19ec7f8724d8a5e8","type":"text","text":"* Tiling and space filling/division\n* Geometrical structure: space filling and partitioning","x":4707,"y":1095,"width":448,"height":170},
