		{"id":"88350c96c2248c0b","type":"text","text":"Adding elements to existing model, e.g.,\n1. Import character model\n2. Sample model surface for points\n3. Use velocity of model to generate trails on sampled points\n4. Instance geometry on sampled points","x":-1694,"y":-1728,"width":545,"height":210},
		{"id":"38ebffac768581a1","type":"text","text":"Example: terrain generation\n1. Create plane\n2. Subdivide plane\n3. Displace plane using noise\n\nOR\n1. Create cube\n2. Voxelize cube (including its volume)\n3. Assign each voxel certain noise value\n4. Remove voxels which have certain value","x":-1693,"y":-2180,"width":570,"height":340},
		{"id":"122fec164fe81c43","type":"link","url":"https://iquilezles.org/demoscene/","x":-2036,"y":240,"width":699,"height":500},
		{"id":"c190e2d01bcdbf38","type":"text","text":"Parameters:\n* Scalar and vectors\n* Fields and arrays\n* Geometry\n* Image\n* etc.","x":-1905,"y":-1102,"width":391,"height":226},
		{"id":"dff3855b3c03ac6f","type":"text","text":"Subtracting elements from existing model, e.g.,\n1. Import character model\n2. Perform Voronoi Tessellation on model - now voronoi cells are available\n3. Create curve \n4. Remove (subtract) cells which are close to curve","x":-1693,"y":-1479,"width":544,"height":239},
